{"id":"z04-20","volume":4,"volumeTitle":"周纪四","volumeSubtitle":"前278","index":20,"title":{"t":"赧王三十七年","s":"赧王三十七年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀四 · 前278 · 癸未","s":"周纪四 · 前278 · 癸未"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"大良造白起领着秦军攻楚，把郢打了下来，还放火烧了夷陵。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"良","s":"良","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"造","s":"造","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"白","s":"白","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"起","s":"起","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"拔","s":"拔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"郢","s":"郢","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"燒","s":"烧","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"夷","s":"夷","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陵","s":"陵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"楚襄王的军队溃散，就此不再交战，把都城朝东北迁到陈。","tokens":[{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"襄","s":"襄","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"兵","s":"兵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"散","s":"散","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"遂","s":"遂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"復","s":"复","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"戰","s":"战","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"東","s":"东","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"北","s":"北","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"徙","s":"徙","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"都","s":"都","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陳","s":"陈","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"秦国把郢改作一个郡，郡名就叫南郡；白起则得到武安君的封号。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"郢","s":"郢","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"為","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"南","s":"南","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"郡","s":"郡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"封","s":"封","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"白","s":"白","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"起","s":"起","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"為","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"武","s":"武","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"安","s":"安","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"君","s":"君","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"这一年是周赧王三十七年，前278年。秦将白起此前已在伊阙大破韩、魏，这一年以南下攻楚。他当时的爵位还是大良造。楚国都城郢失守，先王陵墓所在的夷陵被烧，楚襄王不能再守江汉，只得迁都到陈。","theme":"要记住的是楚国丢掉郢都。军队散了，国都从江汉迁到陈，楚国此后以东边为根本。秦国把占来的郢改成南郡，主将白起也在这一年封为武安君。烧夷陵和迁都是同一仗的两面。","technique":"司马光这一年只写三句短编年，没有对话，也没有臣光曰。第一句是出兵、拔城、烧陵，第二句是兵散和迁都，第三句是设郡与封君。胜负和后果挨在一起，读者不用另找一段议论。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"大良造","reading":"dà liáng zào","note":"秦国的高级爵位。白起出兵时还是这个身份，武安君是拔郢之后才封的。"},{"word":"夷陵","reading":"yí líng","note":"楚先王陵墓所在。烧掉这里，是毁楚的陵寝，不只是烧一座普通城。"},{"word":"南郡","reading":"nán jùn","note":"秦占领郢之后设置的郡。郢从楚都变成秦的郡治。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"遂","reading":"suì","note":"就此、于是。「兵散，遂不复战」是军队一散就不再打。"},{"word":"以","reading":"yǐ","note":"把。「以郢为南郡」是拿郢来设成南郡。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"拔","note":"攻下城池。不是把东西拔出来。"},{"word":"徙","note":"迁移。这里是把都城迁走，不是一般走动。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"东北","note":"方位用作状语，表示朝东北方向迁都。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"以……为……","note":"「以郢为南郡」把甲改设成乙，前一个是原地名，后一个是新郡名。"}]}}
